ell and are more versatile if i am not mistaken but anyways etc, the varied composition also indirectly helps counter picks to invade us (like building spearmen vs chariots, or axes vs swords, hopefully, but anyways etc)). See originally changes in [53.2 - (Fixed and enhanced) Joao AI building way too many defenders (36 longbowmen at turn 130!! Almost all with UNITAI_CITY_DEFENSE or similar) while being boxed in with only 3 cities, instead of making about half of these offense units or versatile ones to punish overextending thin neighbour, fixed by having an early phase "we have expectedly too few cities at this stage of the game, no need to overbuild anymore denders at this stage of the game, switch to offense or versatile UNITAI rather" and "our military composition has way too many defender UNITAIs, switch to offense or versatile UNITAIs", which seemingly fix the issue anyways etc](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs_And_Appendixes/README_Known_Issues_In_Base_AdvCiv_Civ4.md#532---fixed-and-enhanced-joao-ai-building-way-too-many-defenders-36-longbowmen-at-turn-130-almost-all-with-unitai_city_defense-or-similar-while-being-boxed-in-with-only-3-cities-instead-of-making-about-half-of-these-offense-units-or-versatile-ones-to-punish-overextending-thin-neighbour-fixed-by-having-an-early-phase-we-have-expectedly-too-few-cities-at-this-stage-of-the-game-no-need-to-overbuild-anymore-denders-at-this-stage-of-the-game-switch-to-offense-or-versatile-unitai-rather-and-our-military-composition-has-way-too-many-defender-unitais-switch-to-offense-or-versatile-unitais-which-seemingly-fix-the-issue-anyways-etc) and then a more refined and enhanced, as of now final version of these in [53.2.2 (Seemingly greatly enhanced) AI overproducing defenders early on, especially longbowmen but not only, replaced with an early produce more versatile units especially civ-specific ones when defended enough (at least in theory anyways etc) in CvCityAI::AI_chooseUnit anyways etc](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs_And_Appendixes